# Finished-run picture of the example cabinet (horizontal wire ducts, 60 mm high) with the Z slice at 62.5 mm, just past the duct tops: the slice must show no holes where the ducts stand. The picture is for a human; the hole count itself is tested in heat_duct_slice_tests. Needs a release build to finish in minutes.
